<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines details 1996 gold production.</title>
<headline>Philippines details 1996 gold production.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold production figures of Philippines major mines in 1996 according to the Mines and Geosciences Bureau:</p>
<p>					 Quantity (kg)     Value (pesos)</p>
<p> PRIMARY PRODUCERS		  8,091.451	  2,625,130,971</p>
<p> Antamok Gold			 1,575.678	    513,415,667</p>
<p> Itogon Suyoc Mines		   170.994	     56,222,085</p>
<p> Manila Mining Corp		 2,227.035	    719,744,621</p>
<p>*Philex Mining (Bulawan)	  2,808.538	    909,179,324</p>
<p> United Paragon		     1,309.206	    426,569,273</p>
<p> SECONDARY PRODUCERS		6,439.072	  2,155,230,188</p>
<p> Dizon Copper-Gold Operation    2,313.080	    826,825,499</p>
<p> Lepanto Mining		     1,141.763	    369,132,297</p>
<p> Marcopper				 64.340	     19,294,682</p>
<p> Maricalum Mining		     125.333	     36,720,171</p>
<p> Philex (Pacdal)		    2,794.556	    903,257,538</p>
<p>		     SUBTOTAL	14,530.523	  4,780,361,159</p>
<p>		PANNED GOLD	  15,427.610	  5,001,000,000</p>
<p>		TOTAL		  29,958.133	  9,781,361,159</p>
<p>*Estimate --MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936, FAX 817-6267</p>
</text>
